.TH G 6.SH NAMEg \- Atari Graph demonstration.SH SYNOPSIS\fBg\fR.SH DESCRIPTIONA demonstration of the Graph trap library on an OS-9 Atari ST, acompanion to\fBstriche\fR.\fRLoad the library first,\fBload graph\fR,\fRso its calls have somewhere to go.  It was written to run in supervisorstate, and started as an ordinary process it stops at its firstprivileged instruction, aborted..SH NOTESNeeds Microware's\fBcio\fR.\fR\fBDOC/graph\fRdocuments the library..SH SEE ALSOstriche, showpic, apfel